## Summary

The `OpenbisPropertyType` interface defines property type metadata but is missing semantic annotation fields and other properties from the openBIS API. Semantic annotations link properties to ontology terms (e.g., schema.org, OWL) which is important for data interoperability and advanced search features.

## Source Location

**File:** `lib/model/OpenBISModel.ts`
**Line:** 134

## Current Code Context

```typescript
// TODO: add semantic annotation, new properties, etc.
export interface OpenbisPropertyType {
  code: string;
  managedInternally: boolean;
  dataType: OpenbisPropertyDataType;
  registratedBy: OpenbisUser;
  registrationDate: Date;
  label?: string;
  description?: string;
  vocabulary?: string;
  objectType?: string;
  scheme?: string;
  transformation?: string;
  metadata?: Record<string, unknown>;
}
```

## Analysis

Current properties cover basic metadata, but openBIS property types also support:

1. **Semantic Annotations** (ontology links)
   - `semanticAnnotations` - Array of ontology term mappings
   - Each annotation has: predicateOntologyId, predicateOntologyVersion, predicateAccessionId, descriptorOntologyId, descriptorAccessionId

2. **Additional Properties**
   - `permId` - Property type permId
   - `modificationDate` - Last modified
   - `modifiedBy` - User who modified
   - `multiValue` - Whether property can have multiple values
   - `pattern` - Regex validation pattern for VARCHAR
   - `section` - UI section grouping
   - `ordinal` - Display order
   - `showInEditView` / `showRawValueInForms` - UI hints

3. **Vocabulary Details** (for CONTROLLEDVOCABULARY type)
   - Full vocabulary object with terms, descriptions

## Suggested Implementation

1. **Add semantic annotation type**
   ```typescript
   export interface OpenbisSemanticAnnotation {
     permId: string;
     predicateOntologyId: string;
     predicateOntologyVersion: string;
     predicateAccessionId: string;
     descriptorOntologyId?: string;
     descriptorOntologyVersion?: string;
     descriptorAccessionId?: string;
   }
   ```

2. **Extend PropertyType interface**
   ```typescript
   export interface OpenbisPropertyType {
     // ... existing fields ...

     // Identification
     permId: string;
     modificationDate?: Date;
     modifiedBy?: OpenbisUser;

     // Semantic
     semanticAnnotations?: OpenbisSemanticAnnotation[];

     // Validation
     pattern?: string; // Regex for VARCHAR validation
     multiValue?: boolean;

     // UI hints
     section?: string;
     ordinal?: number;
     showInEditView?: boolean;
     showRawValueInForms?: boolean;
   }
   ```

3. **Add vocabulary term type**
   ```typescript
   export interface OpenbisVocabularyTerm {
     code: string;
     label?: string;
     description?: string;
     ordinal: number;
     official: boolean;
   }

   export interface OpenbisVocabulary {
     code: string;
     description?: string;
     urlTemplate?: string;
     terms: OpenbisVocabularyTerm[];
   }
   ```

## Acceptance Criteria

- [ ] SemanticAnnotation interface added
- [ ] PropertyType includes all openBIS API fields
- [ ] Vocabulary and VocabularyTerm types added
- [ ] Used in masterdata property renderers
- [ ] JSDoc comments for complex fields
- [ ] Code passes linting and type checks
- [ ] TODO comment removed after implementation

